    "category": "Stack",
    "difficulty": "Easy",
    "problemStatement": "A string is considered good if it does not contain two adjacent characters that are the same letter but in different cases (for example, 'aA' or 'Bb'). Given a string s, repeatedly remove such adjacent pairs until no more can be removed. Return the final good string.",
